_Easter_event/\">2025 Easter event</a>;</li>\n<li>In <span title=\"Version 1.102.0 (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVmVyc2lvbl8xLjEwMi4wP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Version 1.102.0</span>, on <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/2026_Easter_Event/\">2026 Easter event</a> assortment has been updated;\n<ul><li><span title=\"Royal Eggift (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm95YWxfRWdnaWZ0P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Royal Eggift</span> and <span title=\"Gift of Eggceleration (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvR2lmdF9vZl9FZ2djZWxlcmF0aW9uP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Gift of Eggceleration</span> have been removed and replaced with <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Yolkmobile_MK2%3A_Turbo/\">Yolkmobile MK2: Turbo</a> and <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Western_Eggift/\">Western Eggift</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>"}
